==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 7.33 seconds<sup>220f</sup>, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Doge]]s spawn as bosses after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5.67 seconds<sup>170f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite King Doge seeming like a powerful foe, in reality it is extremely weak, treat this as you would any other beginner-like stage.

